      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Railway Parcel Integration &amp; Corporate Bill Acceptance for Two‑Wheeler Moves from Rajampet</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;">**Shree Ashirwad: Bridging Road Transport and Railway Bike Parcel Services**

Shree Ashirwad has built a seamless logistics ecosystem that intertwines road transport with the *indian railway bike parcel service* network. By integrating real‑time GPS tracking with the railway’s parcel APIs, the company guarantees that a bike or parcel picked up at a city hub is automatically queued for dispatch via *railway bike transport*. The system cross‑checks the train timetable, berth availability, and the vehicle’s weight limits, ensuring that each parcel is routed to the most efficient rail corridor. This synchronization eliminates idle road time, reduces fuel consumption, and cuts delivery windows by up to 30 %.

**Handling IRCTC Bookings**

When a customer or corporate client needs to book a ticket, Shree Ashirwad’s platform taps into the IRCTC API to pull up all available trains, seat classes, and fare details. The user interface presents a single‑click booking experience: the client selects the origin, destination, and preferred travel class, and the system automatically calculates the total fare, applies any corporate discount codes, and reserves the seat. Post‑booking, the platform sends an electronic ticket to the client’s email and updates the central ledger with the transaction ID, making reconciliation straightforward for the finance team.

**Corporate & Government Bill Reimbursement**

For corporate or government entities, Shree Ashirwad offers a dedicated billing portal. Once a bike parcel or train ticket is delivered, the system automatically generates an itemized invoice that includes the rail fare, road transport fee, handling charges, and applicable GST. These invoices are then uploaded to the company’s ERP or submitted via the portal for reimbursement. The platform supports bulk uploads, audit trails, and electronic signatures, ensuring compliance with government procurement rules. By automating the entire cycle—from booking through delivery to invoicing—Shree Ashirwad reduces paperwork, speeds up reimbursements, and provides real‑time visibility into every leg of the journey.

In essence, Shree Ashirwad’s integrated approach to *railway bike transport* and road logistics not only streamlines operations but also delivers a transparent, cost‑effective solution for businesses and government agencies that rely on timely parcel delivery and travel booking.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



