<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transportation in Rajampet | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting AP-04 / AP-39
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure zero scratches during bike transportation in Rajampet?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our zero‑scratch guarantee stems from a three‑layer safety protocol: first, a pre‑loading audit verifies bike condition and packaging integrity; second, the hydraulic ramp and padded cradles secure the bike without contact points; third, the 7‑layer all‑weather crate cushions against vibration and impacts. Combined with live GPS monitoring, any deviation triggers immediate corrective action, ensuring your bike arrives pristine.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the process for booking a bike parcel through IRCTC versus road transport from Rajampet?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For IRCTC bike parcels, you submit a booking request on the IRCTC portal, provide bike dimensions, and receive a rail‑wayway bill; Shree Ashirwad then handles door‑to‑door pickup, packs the bike in our 7‑layer crate, and loads it onto the designated freight wagon. Road transport involves a direct online quote, doorstep pickup, hydraulic ramp loading onto our closed container truck, and real‑time GPS tracking—all completed without rail coordination.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any size or weight restrictions for two‑wheelers on the hydraulic ramp trailers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our hydraulic ramp trailers accommodate standard motorcycles up to 250 kg curb weight and a maximum length of 2.2 m. Heavy‑duty bikes exceeding these limits are placed on dedicated multi‑axle flatbeds with custom cradles. All dimensions are verified during the pre‑loading audit to ensure safe loading and compliance with highway regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the 7‑layer packaging different from standard bike wrapping services in Kolhapur or elsewhere?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 7‑layer system combines 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard sheets, moisture‑resistant stretch film, reinforced wooden crates, anti‑static inner liners, and a final weather‑proof outer seal. Unlike typical single‑layer wraps used in many cities, our protocol offers multi‑directional shock absorption, dust protection, and structural rigidity, guaranteeing superior defense against road vibrations and climate exposure.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for corporate bill reimbursement for bike shifting from Rajampet?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To claim corporate reimbursement, provide a GST‑registered invoice, the original transport bill (road or railway), a signed delivery receipt, and a copy of the insurance policy. If the move is for a government or PSU entity, include the authorized expense claim form and the IRCTC parcel booking confirmation where applicable.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the live GPS tracking work for my bike during the 850 km journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each container truck is equipped with a satellite‑linked GPS unit that updates location every five minutes. Clients receive a secure link to a live tracking dashboard showing real‑time position, speed, and estimated arrival. Alerts are triggered for route deviations, unauthorized stops, or temperature spikes, ensuring full visibility and immediate response.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I claim the full insured value if my bike gets damaged despite the safety measures?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our 100% IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covers the declared market value of your bike. In the unlikely event of damage, you file a claim within 48 hours, submit the damage report, photographs, and the original insurance certificate. Our claims team processes reimbursement swiftly, typically within 7‑10 business days.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
